{
  "name": "exec_unsent_failure_on_paused_box_raises",
  "description": "An unsent box failure re-enters the readiness wait, and the wait's own verdict ends the call: a box that reads paused raises box_not_running, not retryable, exactly as sandboxes.waitReady does. The retry has no attempt ceiling, so this verdict is what stops a call on a box nobody will resume.",
